 "readme": {
  "file": "README.md",
  "title": "The Weil Conjectures in Lean",
  "excerpt": "A Lean 4 (v4.34.0-rc2) formalization of the proof of the Weil conjectures, following E. Freitag and R. Kiehl, *Étale Cohomology and the Weil Conjecture* (Ergebnisse der Mathematik 13, Springer, 1988), built on [Mathlib](https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4) and on [the Stacks Project in Lean](https://github.com/AxiomMath/Stacks). All four Weil conjectures are proved: rationality, the functional equation, the Riemann hypothesis (Deligne's theorem) and the Betti-number statement. Lean's kernel checks every proof. There is no `sorry`, no `native_decide` and no added axiom."
 },
